sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API_GW as API Gateway
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Queue
    participant Worker
    participant Storage
    participant Audit

    Client->>API_GW: POST /compare {idempotency_key, payload}
    API_GW->>API_GW: authenticate & rate-limit
    API_GW->>Orchestrator: create operation (operation_id)
    API_GW->>Payment: authorize (operation_id, amount)
    Payment-->>API_GW: auth_ok (payment_operation_id)
    Orchestrator->>Queue: enqueue shards (operation_id, shard_id)
    Queue->>Worker: deliver shard
    Worker->>Storage: upload shard result
    Worker->>Queue: emit shard_complete (operation_id, shard_id)
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: aggregate shards
    Orchestrator->>Payment: capture (operation_id, payment_operation_id)
    Payment-->>Orchestrator: capture_ok
    Orchestrator->>Audit: append final event
